[{"source" ":org/Math-Academy" "forms" [{:db/id 17592186157424 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-33021c77-54f7-572b-82bd-06940f46518d"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-33021c77-54f7-572b-82bd-06940f46518d" :question/id #uuid "33021c77-54f7-572b-82bd-06940f46518d" :question/math-academy-id "q-102691" :question/problem "Given that \n${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}2x{y}^{2}-2x & 2y{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}],$ \nevaluate the Hessian determinant of $f(x,y)$ at the point $(1,-1).$" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f:{R}^{n}\\to R,$ given by\n\n$$\nf:{{[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ ⋮ \\\\ {x}_{n}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{x}⟶f({x}_{1},{x}_{2},…,{x}_{n}),\n$$\n\nthe second derivative of $f$ is given by the $n\\times n$ matrix\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe Hessian determinant $H(x,y)$ is the determinant of the second derivative:\n\n$$\nH(x)=det({f}^{″}(x))\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFirst, notice that since\n${f}^{′}(x,y)=[\\begin{aligned}2x{y}^{2}-2x & 2y{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}],$\nwe must have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂x}=2x{y}^{2}-2x,\\,\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=2y{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the second partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2x{y}^{2}-2x)=2{y}^{2}-2\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(2y{x}^{2})=4xy \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2x{y}^{2}-2x)=4xy\\, & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}} & =\\frac{∂}{∂y}(2y{x}^{2})=2{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second derivative is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(x,y) & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2{y}^{2}-2 & 4xy \\\\ 4xy & 2{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nEvaluating the second derivative at $(1,-1),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(1,-1)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\nH(1,-1)=0\\cdot 2-(-4)\\cdot (-4)=-16.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-905b588f-0f57-5923-a81f-afb037b87739"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-905b588f-0f57-5923-a81f-afb037b87739" :answer-field/id #uuid "905b588f-0f57-5923-a81f-afb037b87739" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274" "answer-376b6d35-c19b-56a0-93ca-9e64900695ac" "answer-d5b9d20a-a2bf-5378-921c-e265c88f998e" "answer-57cd56c0-cc2d-5c47-9c19-0fd322aee1ce" "answer-4d63a9d4-f48b-551f-a330-cb4773261398"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274" :answer/id #uuid "7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-376b6d35-c19b-56a0-93ca-9e64900695ac" :answer/id #uuid "376b6d35-c19b-56a0-93ca-9e64900695ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-24" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d5b9d20a-a2bf-5378-921c-e265c88f998e" :answer/id #uuid "d5b9d20a-a2bf-5378-921c-e265c88f998e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-57cd56c0-cc2d-5c47-9c19-0fd322aee1ce" :answer/id #uuid "57cd56c0-cc2d-5c47-9c19-0fd322aee1ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :