& =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂x∂y} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂y∂x} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{y}^{2}}\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2{y}^{2}-2 & 4xy \\\\ 4xy & 2{x}^{2}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nEvaluating the second derivative at $(1,-1),$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{″}(1,-1)=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -4 \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we have\n\n$$\nH(1,-1)=0\\cdot 2-(-4)\\cdot (-4)=-16.\n$$"] ["question-33021c77-54f7-572b-82bd-06940f46518d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-905b588f-0f57-5923-a81f-afb037b87739" :answer-field/id #uuid "905b588f-0f57-5923-a81f-afb037b87739"] ["answer-7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274" :answer/id #uuid "7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274"] ["answer-7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7f6fbe7f-9b92-59d9-8aed-d5539feec274" :answer/value "-16"] ["answer-376b6d35-c19b-56a0-93ca-9e64900695ac" :answer/id #uuid "376b6d35-c19b-56a0-93ca-9e64900695ac"] ["answer-376b6d35-c19b-56a0-93ca-9e64900695ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-376b6d35-c19b-56a0-93ca-9e64900695ac" :answer/value "-24"] ["answer-d5b9d20a-a2bf-5378-921c-e265c88f998e" :answer/id #uuid "d5b9d20a-a2bf-5378-921c-e265c88f998e"] ["answer-d5b9d20a-a2bf-5378-921c-e265c88f998e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-d5b9d20a-a2bf-5378-921c-e265c88f998e" :answer/value "-8"] ["answer-57cd56c0-cc2d-5c47-9c19-0fd322aee1ce" :answer/id #uuid "57cd56c0-cc2d-5c47-9c19-0fd322aee1ce"] ["answer-57cd56c0-cc2d-5c47-9c19-0fd322aee1ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-57cd56c0-cc2d-5c47-9c19-0fd322aee1ce" :answer/value "16"] ["answer-4d63a9d4-f48b-551f-a330-cb4773261398" :answer/id #uuid "4d63a9d4-f48b-551f-a330-cb4773261398"] ["answer-4d63a9d4-f48b-551f-a330-cb4773261398" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4d63a9d4-f48b-551f-a330-cb4773261398" :answer/value "8"] ["answer-field-905b588f-0f57-5923-a81f-afb037b87739" :ans